      "id": "deliverables_moriarty_agentic_council_record_2026_09_03_audit_triple",
      "label": "Core, Generated Compact, and Certificate Audit Triple",
      "rationale": "Requires the auditable unit to consist of normalized Core, generated Compact, and an independently checked translation-validation certificate to protect against correlated defects.",
